WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Playing live
Pick a style, play chords, and the band follows.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:08.580
1. Pick a style
On the Home page, turn KNOB 1 (Style) to Funk.

3
00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:14.588
2. Play chords
Hold three keys or more, then press PLAY. Polly names the chord, and the band plays it.

4
00:00:14.588 --> 00:00:26.388
2. Play chords
The chord keeps playing when you let go. Play Em7 and A7, two bars each.

5
00:00:26.388 --> 00:00:35.988
3. Go busier
Hold HOME and press black key 4. A fill plays, then the busier Groove B.

6
00:00:35.988 --> 00:00:45.588
4. Come back down
Hold HOME and press black key 4 again. A fill plays, then Groove A.

7
00:00:45.588 --> 00:00:57.836
5. End it
Hold HOME and press black key 5. The Ending plays, then Polly stops.

8
00:00:57.836 --> 00:01:01.900
Next: 102
Your own progressions.
